{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "150", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Definitely. Obviously, it's worth going there just for the view,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8261852679228229, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "but the food is supposed to be really special.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.4635411268087068, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): She only likes cooking with local products, doesn't she?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.787316520061109, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yes. Everything at the restaurant has to be sourced within a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8264881266363623, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "short distance and absolutely nothing flown in from abroad.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.614972277765116, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): I imagine it's really expensive, though.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.6081187921781253, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Well, you could go for the set lunch. That's quite reasonable", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.826212539560535, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "for a top class restaurant. £30 ahead. In the evening, I think it would be more like", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8261441554163472, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "£50.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.056287840038106475, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): At least that, I should think. But I'm sure everyone would", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8261992113165404, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "enjoy it. It's not the kind of place you leave feeling hungry, though, is it? With tiny", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8262291486030514, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "portions?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.10566633120501781, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): No, the reviews I've read didn't mention that. I imagine they'd", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8262867676270896, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "be average.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.12824241574217352, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Well, that's all great. Thank.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.5056697068391218, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Part 2", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.06840853231120056, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Part two, you will hear a potter, Heather Macllum, speaking to a group of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.771326138747225, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people who are visiting a pottery, a place where people make pots and other", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.7718776204737412, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "objects from clay. First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16. Now", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.7715002261187857, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7186767214798736, "w": 0.4716039711195407, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Heather McCallum: Hello and welcome. My name's Heather McCallum and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7468587510386585, "w": 0.771347668987524, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I'm one of the potters who work here at Adelman Pottery. Before we go into", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7751891011127962, "w": 0.771575684484786, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the workshop, I just want to say a bit about the craft of pottery. Then we'll", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8035195266297188, "w": 0.7711735816159635, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "have a look at the equipment and you can try making a pot of your own. Like", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8318498767038565, "w": 0.7717613571761265, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "many people, I'm sure you know that pottery as an art form is tens of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8602049720114812, "w": 0.7718944345661651, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "thousands of years old. And we know this because it stands the test of time.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8885353220856188, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Things like baskets and pictures don't survive in the earth in the same way", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9168656721597565, "w": 0.7714786958784866, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}